          "evidence": [
            "`src/workflows/work-on.ts` sends `ctx.signal` to `github.mergePullRequest` in the parent merge node.",
            "The merge-failure rollback at the frozen base calls `projector.setWorkflowLabel(link.issueNumber, WORKFLOW_LABEL_BY_STAGE.review)` without `ctx.signal`; this avoids the cited aborted-signal failure but is implicit and untested.",
            "`GitHubIssueProjector.setWorkflowLabel` forwards a supplied signal to both the issue GET and labels PUT; `FetchGitHubTransport` passes it to `fetch`, so an already-aborted signal prevents rollback requests.",
